### 1. Erfolgreiche Buchung erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courtId": 1,
  "customerId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-09-01T14:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-01T16:00:00"
}

### 2. Doppelbuchung testen (sollte fehlschlagen)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courtId": 1,
  "customerId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-09-01T15:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-01T17:00:00"
}